From 1552ec1a56f821806aae90c4c972758dde582549 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: scottstechx-ship-it <scottsstechx@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 01:07:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix: repair broken dashboards, links, media and login
 flows across the site
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dashboards
- admin/app.js: fix syntax error ('[data-save']' -> '[data-save]') that crashed
  the entire Admin dashboard on load
- sync top-level role dashboards (admin, teacher, parent, super-admin) with the
  full-featured platform/ versions: restores attendance marking, assignments,
  exams, timetable, fees, import wizard, user management, school settings and
  activity logs that were missing from the simplified copies
- keep role-specific login redirects (/platform/login-<role>.html)

Login flows
- add missing /login.html (api.js logout and server / redirect pointed at a 404)
- login-premium.js: store token under scp_token/scp_user (the keys dashboards
  actually read) in addition to legacy kalinabiri_* keys
- login-premium.js: fix broken redirect that mangled the origin — use absolute paths

Broken links & assets
- add ../css/platform-ux.css at the paths every dashboard references
- create /academics/, /news/, /calendar/ and /academics/a-level.html redirect
  pages for nav links that 404'd
- fix /app/ and /app/gallery/ links on staff and gallery pages
- point missing local images/videos at the hosted archive on
  kalibz-international.netlify.app with existing onerror fallbacks preserved
- assets/js/api.js + dataapi.js: use same-origin /api instead of localhost:3000

Security
- CSP: allow remote media host, Google Fonts, cdnjs, analytics hosts the
  public site already uses, plus media-src/font-src/frame-src directives

Verified: 54/54 API tests pass, all frontend smoke tests pass, every HTML
page and asset returns 200, all five roles log in and reach their core
endpoints, Socket.IO realtime connects.
