Subject: [PATCH 2/3] test: add deep dashboard test that opens all 64 views
 across all 5 dashboards

Boots each dashboard's real JS in jsdom against the live API, switches to
every nav view (home, messages, documents, announcements, users, students,
teachers, parents, classes, subjects, attendance, assignments, exams,
timetable, fees, import, settings, permissions, security, backup, logs,
notifications, profile, children, results) and asserts no JS errors and
non-empty renders.
---
