- hamburger drawer on phones with scrim, ESC close, body scroll lock,
  48px touch targets, active-page highlighting
- removes all legacy per-page navbars (4 different designs before)
- global mobile polish: 16px inputs (no iOS zoom), fluid headings,
  overflow-safe tables/images, reduced-motion support

LOGIN SCREENS
- /platform/login.html fully redesigned: animated gradient orbs, glass
  card, role chips, password show/hide, loading spinner, mobile-first
- all 5 role login pages: back-to-website link + password visibility
  toggle + small-screen padding fixes

VERIFIED
- 25/25 website-content API tests (tests/website-content.test.js)
- 69/69 dashboard views render (incl. 5 new views)
- 56/56 mobile nav checks across 7 public pages
- 54/54 backend API tests + full frontend smoke suite still green
